{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2021-09-30 06:20:00', 'title': 'FTSE4GOOD INDEX INCLUDES LINDE FOR SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'GUILDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN INCLUDED IN THE FTSE4GOOD INDEX FOR THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. CREATED BY THE GLOBAL INDEX PROVIDER FTSE RUSSELL, THE FTSE4GOOD INDEX SERIES IS A TOOL FOR INVESTORS SEEKING COMPANIES THAT DEMONSTRATE STRONG SUSTAINABILITY PRACTICES.'}